            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A skateboard ramp is 5 m long and rises a vertical distance of 2 m. What angle does the ramp make with the horizontal ground? Give your answer correct to the nearest degree.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$24^\\circ$",
      "worked": "Let $\\theta$ be the angle the ramp makes with the ground. The rise is opposite and the ramp is the hypotenuse.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sin\\theta&=\\frac{2}{5}\\\\\\theta&=\\sin^{-1}\\left(\\frac{2}{5}\\right)\\\\\\theta&\\approx24^\\circ.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 45
  },
